  "description": "GPS, motion activity and geocoding endpoints for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app, backed by Shiny.Gps — permissions, current and last position, a listener streamed to the page as events, walking/running/driving recognition, and reverse geocoding. One call each: bridge.AddGpsBridge(), bridge.AddMotionActivityBridge(), bridge.AddGeocodingBridge().",
